WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.792 --> 00:00:17.792
[â™ª legendary music playing]

2
00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:19.417
[lightsaber activates]

3
00:00:22.792 --> 00:00:23.792
[â™ª music fades]

4
00:00:26.042 --> 00:00:27.542
[â™ª theme music playing]

5
00:00:27.625 --> 00:00:31.042
[narrator] <i>The era of the Jedi</i>
<i>and the Sith has ended.</i>

6
00:00:31.125 --> 00:00:33.250
<i>They have all but disappeared.</i>

7
00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:37.583
<i>and with them. the ancient art</i>
<i>of crafting their sacred weapon.</i>

8
00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:39.958
<i>the lightsaber.</i>

9
00:00:40.042 --> 00:00:46.583
<i>A terrible age of conflict now mires</i>
<i>the galaxy in chaos as warlords rise.</i>

10
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:52.542
<i>Among them. the fierce masked general.</i>
<i>Nawaam. has emerged.</i>

11
00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:58.250
<i>spreading terror as planets fall under</i>
<i>his control at an alarming rate.</i>

12
00:00:58.333 --> 00:01:03.917
<i>Amid this. Margrave Juro works</i>
<i>to bring back the Jedi Order</i>

13
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.125
<i>in hope that they can restore</i>
<i>peace and justice to the galaxy.</i>

14
00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:14.083
[â™ª music concludes]

15
00:01:17.542 --> 00:01:19.250
[â™ª thrilling music playing]

16
00:01:19.333 --> 00:01:20.875
[ship whooshes]

17
00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:22.083
[gasps. grunts]

18
00:01:22.167 --> 00:01:24.125
[laser cannons firing]

19
00:01:32.542 --> 00:01:35.792
How are they doing this? They keep finding
us no matter how many times we jump.

20
00:01:35.875 --> 00:01:38.458
There must be a tracker
on the ship somewhere.

21
00:01:38.542 --> 00:01:41.208
They probably put one on us
during our first run-in.

22
00:01:41.292 --> 00:01:42.750
[Kara over comms] <i>What?</i>

23
00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:44.750
[droid chirping]

24
00:01:44.833 --> 00:01:46.667
{\an8}-[whooshes]
-[laser cannons firing]

25
00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:53.167
[Gennoh] Lord Nawaam. I will soon
have Margrave Juro's ship.

26
00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:56.458
This will be the day
I wipe out his pathetic group

27
00:01:56.542 --> 00:01:58.625
and return with all of their lightsabers.

28
00:01:58.708 --> 00:02:02.375
[Nawaam] <i>Our enemies see themselves</i>
<i>as masterless Jedi.</i>

29
00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:05.042
<i>You'd be wise to not let your guard down.</i>

30
00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:08.083
I. Gennoh. would never
back down from any Jedi.

31
00:02:08.167 --> 00:02:10.000
[Nawaam] <i>Very well.</i>

32
00:02:10.083 --> 00:02:12.292
<i>Then show me the power of the last Sith.</i>

33
00:02:12.375 --> 00:02:14.042
[Gennoh] As you wish.

34
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.000
[explosion]

35
00:02:21.458 --> 00:02:23.583
[alarm blaring]

36
00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.167
[whimpers]

37
00:02:33.833 --> 00:02:35.583
[whooshes]

38
00:02:36.417 --> 00:02:38.125
-[thuds]
-[Homen and Juro grunt]

39
00:02:38.917 --> 00:02:41.083
Master. the ship's navicomputer is down.

40
00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:42.958
And what about the backup?

41
00:02:43.042 --> 00:02:44.792
Those are all shot as well.

42
00:02:44.875 --> 00:02:47.708
There's no way we'll be able
to make a jump to hyperspace without them.

43
00:02:47.792 --> 00:02:49.417
Can you repair it. Kara?

44
00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.333
[Kara over comms] <i>There's no time.</i>
<i>We won't make it.</i>

45
00:02:51.417 --> 00:02:53.500
All right. Take the controls. Gramps.

46
00:02:53.583 --> 00:02:57.000
Get ready to make the jump
as soon as we get into a better position.

47
00:02:57.083 --> 00:03:00.750
[Gramps] Good grief. Very reckless. kid.
Very reckless.

48
00:03:00.833 --> 00:03:02.292
The coordinates?

49
00:03:02.375 --> 00:03:04.833
[Gramps] I've got all that stuff
up here in my noggin.

50
00:03:04.917 --> 00:03:07.083
-Well. then. where are you taking us?
-[Gramps grumbles]

51
00:03:07.167 --> 00:03:08.167
[Homen grunts]

52
00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:09.792
[â™ª thrilling music playing]

53
00:03:11.833 --> 00:03:14.750
[Gennoh] Jump as many times
as you wish. It's still futile.

54
00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.750
I have you now.

55
00:03:23.625 --> 00:03:25.333
-[rumbling]
-[grunts]

56
00:03:25.417 --> 00:03:26.625
[gasps]

57
00:03:26.708 --> 00:03:28.167
[distant alarm wailing]

58
00:03:32.667 --> 00:03:35.542
[Kara gasps] Gramps.
are you seeing what I'm seeing?

59
00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:39.333
[Homen] Do something. We're being
pulled right into that black hole.

60
00:03:39.417 --> 00:03:43.500
[Gramps] Relax. A ship this nimble
will be able to make it out easy.

61
00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:47.750
Not sure about that big clunker
behind us. though. [chuckles]

62
00:03:48.542 --> 00:03:50.625
[droid] <i>High gravitational pull detected.</i>

63
00:03:50.708 --> 00:03:52.208
<i>Navigation disabled.</i>

64
00:03:53.125 --> 00:03:55.208
[Gennoh] Of all the petty tricks...

65
00:03:55.292 --> 00:03:56.958
That was quick thinking.

66
00:03:57.042 --> 00:03:58.708
Quite the strategy. Gramps.

67
00:03:58.792 --> 00:04:01.208
Enough compliments.
We need to get out of here now.

68
00:04:01.292 --> 00:04:03.708
[Gramps] Things are about to get
a little bumpy.

69
00:04:03.792 --> 00:04:05.792
[â™ª thrilling music continues]

70
00:04:05.875 --> 00:04:07.667
[whooshes]

71
00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:09.125
[Kara grunts]

72
00:04:09.208 --> 00:04:10.583
[screams]

73
00:04:11.625 --> 00:04:13.500
[engines revving]

74
00:04:20.375 --> 00:04:21.458
[whooshing]

75
00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.333
Whoo-hoo!

76
00:04:26.417 --> 00:04:27.625
Gramps. you're the best!

77
00:04:28.417 --> 00:04:32.083
[Gramps] That is accurate.
We have escaped the black hole.

78
00:04:32.167 --> 00:04:34.792
Now then.
where shall we jump to next?

79
00:04:34.875 --> 00:04:38.125
Our best course of action
would be to head to Makoma Ko.

80
00:04:38.208 --> 00:04:39.625
Set a course immediately.

81
00:04:39.708 --> 00:04:41.000
[Gramps] All righty.

82
00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:43.333
[whooshes]

83
00:04:47.042 --> 00:04:49.042
-[â™ª dramatic music playing]
-[parts clattering]

84
00:04:56.958 --> 00:04:57.958
-[alarm blaring]
-[rumbling]

85
00:04:58.042 --> 00:04:59.542
[droid] <i>We have insufficient thrust.</i>

86
00:05:00.083 --> 00:05:01.542
[Gennoh] I'll handle this.

87
00:05:03.917 --> 00:05:05.625
[ship rumbling]

88
00:05:12.875 --> 00:05:14.875
[straining]

89
00:05:18.542 --> 00:05:19.542
[whooshes]

90
00:05:22.375 --> 00:05:24.375
[â™ª serene music playing]

91
00:05:29.083 --> 00:05:30.500
[ship engine whirring]

92
00:05:35.542 --> 00:05:37.375
[Kara] So this is Makoma Ko.

93
00:05:39.042 --> 00:05:41.250
[Juro] It's ruled by a man named Dunbai.

94
00:05:41.333 --> 00:05:43.708
He was a Jedi a long time ago.

95
00:05:43.792 --> 00:05:46.250
A Jedi. that's a surprise.

96
00:05:46.333 --> 00:05:48.000
Dunbai is well known.

97
00:05:48.083 --> 00:05:50.708
He's one of the wealthiest merchants
in the Outer Rim.

98
00:05:50.792 --> 00:05:53.042
Hard to imagine he was once a Jedi.

99
00:05:53.875 --> 00:05:58.250
Hmm. Then I really hope
he'll be able to help us.

100
00:05:59.417 --> 00:06:01.458
[â™ª valiant music playing]

101
00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:08.250
[ship hisses]

102
00:06:08.333 --> 00:06:10.375
[alien speaking alien language]

103
00:06:10.458 --> 00:06:12.833
-[indistinct conversations]
-[droid warbles]

104
00:06:19.625 --> 00:06:21.625
[â™ª enthralling music playing]

105
00:06:25.458 --> 00:06:26.958
[birds chirping]

106
00:06:36.958 --> 00:06:38.167
[droid chirps]

107
00:06:39.417 --> 00:06:40.417
[grunts]

108
00:06:42.167 --> 00:06:47.083
Apologies. Margrave. but I'm afraid I will
be unable to lend you any assistance.

109
00:06:47.167 --> 00:06:49.250
Lord Dunbai. do you mean to say

110
00:06:49.333 --> 00:06:52.292
that you will allow the galaxy
to continue to fall into chaos?

111
00:06:52.958 --> 00:06:56.708
My primary duty must be
to protect my home. Makoma Ko.

112
00:06:56.792 --> 00:06:58.750
My hands are full enough with that.

113
00:07:00.208 --> 00:07:01.583
-[Dunbai grunts]
-[gasps]

114
00:07:04.917 --> 00:07:06.750
Hmm. What's this?

115
00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:09.917
It is a saber forged by Lah Zhima.

116
00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:14.667
I ask you again. will you take this up
and fight once more as a Jedi?

117
00:07:18.542 --> 00:07:21.167
[Dunbai] You will never be able
to bring back the Jedi Order

118
00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.167
with such a paltry number.

119
00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.833
And furthermore.
there is no master among you.

120
00:07:26.583 --> 00:07:30.750
[grunts] You're wrong. We do have
a master. and his name is Margrave Juro.

121
00:07:32.292 --> 00:07:33.292
[whimpers]

122
00:07:34.333 --> 00:07:36.708
If you have the strength
to stand up against Nawaam.

123
00:07:36.792 --> 00:07:38.667
I have no doubt others will follow.

124
00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:42.125
This is an opportunity to provide them
with a beacon of hope.

125
00:07:43.708 --> 00:07:45.083
-[Dunbai] Hmm.
-[droid warbles]

126
00:07:45.167 --> 00:07:46.667
[Dunbai] That may be.

127
00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:50.792
However. blindly gathering others
won't bring the Jedi back.

128
00:07:50.875 --> 00:07:53.833
I can only hope that you will
not find yourselves crushed

129
00:07:53.917 --> 00:07:56.667
if you insist on pursuing
this fool-hearted quest.

130
00:07:57.458 --> 00:08:00.750
Although I seriously doubt
this Nawaam would be the one to do it.

131
00:08:01.542 --> 00:08:03.875
You should not underestimate Nawaam.

132
00:08:03.958 --> 00:08:06.458
As we speak. he is busy amassing a fleet.

133
00:08:06.542 --> 00:08:08.958
and soon it will be
the biggest in the galaxy.

134
00:08:09.625 --> 00:08:12.042
His Nobuseri fighters are a problem.

135
00:08:12.125 --> 00:08:15.625
A throng of brutes
who have never bent the knee to anyone

136
00:08:15.708 --> 00:08:17.667
now swear allegiance to him.

137
00:08:18.583 --> 00:08:22.042
What do you imagine
he may have promised them in return?

138
00:08:22.125 --> 00:08:24.875
Nawaam's danger lies at the heart
of what that may be.

139
00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:26.500
Hmm.

140
00:08:27.417 --> 00:08:30.417
[Kara] I thought you said
Dunbai used to be a Jedi.

141
00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.917
Seems he's no more
than a greedy merchant now.

142
00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:36.125
Does this mean that he really
isn't going to help us?

143
00:08:38.542 --> 00:08:39.917
[Homen and Kara grunt]

144
00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.875
Who is this girl with you?

145
00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:47.083
Lah Kara. She is Zhima's daughter.

146
00:08:49.167 --> 00:08:50.500
[gasps]

147
00:08:50.583 --> 00:08:52.292
So then he survived?

148
00:08:52.375 --> 00:08:56.500
Yes. But he was abducted.
likely on Nawaam's orders.

149
00:08:56.583 --> 00:09:01.708
So you are traveling with Margrave Juro
in search of your father. is that correct?

150
00:09:02.333 --> 00:09:03.958
How brave of you.

151
00:09:04.042 --> 00:09:07.083
We need your help.
Please lend us your aid.

152
00:09:07.167 --> 00:09:09.917
I fear. without it.
I won't be able to find my father.

153
00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:13.292
I'm sorry.
but as I have already explained.

154
00:09:13.375 --> 00:09:16.333
what matters most to me
is protecting this planet and its people.

155
00:09:16.417 --> 00:09:17.875
And so I cannot help you.

156
00:09:18.542 --> 00:09:20.750
But you're not safe just sitting idly by.

157
00:09:21.833 --> 00:09:22.833
I thought that once.

158
00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:26.542
Until one day they came
and took what matters most.

159
00:09:27.833 --> 00:09:29.125
[gasps]

160
00:09:29.208 --> 00:09:31.792
I'm sorry. I should not have
spoken to you that way.

161
00:09:33.958 --> 00:09:36.917
I apologize for speaking like that.
Margrave Juro.

162
00:09:38.167 --> 00:09:39.792
It's quite all right.

163
00:09:39.875 --> 00:09:42.167
You have expressed my sentiments exactly.

164
00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:47.125
Although there is one thing. Kara.
you can just call me Juro. remember?

165
00:09:47.833 --> 00:09:49.375
Yes. Juro.

166
00:09:53.833 --> 00:09:55.458
-[building rumbling]
-[all gasp]

167
00:09:57.125 --> 00:09:59.542
[attendant panting]

168
00:09:59.625 --> 00:10:01.167
[whispers indistinctly]

169
00:10:03.333 --> 00:10:06.250
It appears you and your friends
have brought trouble to our door.

170
00:10:06.875 --> 00:10:08.208
[Juro] Hmm?

171
00:10:08.292 --> 00:10:10.042
[â™ª tense music playing]

172
00:10:19.333 --> 00:10:23.083
[Gennoh] Did you think you could get away
from me with that little stunt?

173
00:10:23.167 --> 00:10:25.542
How naive of you. Jedi.

174
00:10:25.625 --> 00:10:26.792
[whirring]

175
00:10:28.083 --> 00:10:29.833
[gasps] How'd they find us?

176
00:10:29.917 --> 00:10:31.667
I thought we destroyed the tracker.

177
00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:34.458
[Homen] We did destroy it.
When we arrived at the spaceport.

178
00:10:34.542 --> 00:10:36.417
-[indistinct droid chatter]
-[all exclaim]

179
00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:40.958
I wonder how he managed to escape
the gravitational pull of the black hole.

180
00:10:41.042 --> 00:10:43.292
Unfortunate. but very impressive.

181
00:10:43.375 --> 00:10:45.125
[both] Can you please stop praising him?

182
00:10:48.458 --> 00:10:51.417
Excuse me. sir. we are receiving
an incoming transmission.

183
00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:52.917
It is from Nawaam's army.

184
00:10:59.917 --> 00:11:00.917
[whirring]

185
00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:05.750
<i>I am Commander Gennoh of Nawaam's army.</i>

186
00:11:06.667 --> 00:11:10.083
<i>We have been informed that you are</i>
<i>harboring these seditious Jedi.</i>

187
00:11:10.167 --> 00:11:12.333
<i>and we demand</i>
<i>that you hand them over to us.</i>

188
00:11:13.542 --> 00:11:16.167
Well. I'm afraid
I have received no reports

189
00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:18.792
of any such Jedi hiding on this planet.

190
00:11:18.875 --> 00:11:19.917
Isn't that right?

191
00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:22.125
[Gennoh] <i>Have you no shame?</i>

192
00:11:22.208 --> 00:11:24.083
But even if they were here.

193
00:11:24.167 --> 00:11:28.375
I would not be duty-bound
to turn them over to your custody.

194
00:11:28.458 --> 00:11:31.875
Might I remind you
that Makoma Ko are a free city-state.

195
00:11:31.958 --> 00:11:35.250
As such. we are not under
the control of the Nawaam army.

196
00:11:35.333 --> 00:11:38.333
And in terms of rival warlords
we may be bound to. there are none.

197
00:11:38.417 --> 00:11:40.125
[Gennoh] <i>You wretched cur.</i>

198
00:11:40.208 --> 00:11:42.042
<i>Do you intend to defy General Nawaam?</i>

199
00:11:42.125 --> 00:11:44.542
And what is it that you intend?

200
00:11:44.625 --> 00:11:48.708
Perhaps you intend to violate
the autonomy of Makoma Ko.

201
00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:53.375
Is he doing what I think he's doing?

202
00:11:53.458 --> 00:11:55.417
'Cause it looks like he's helping us.

203
00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:58.417
-No matter how stubborn Dunbai may be...
-[Kara] Hmm?

204
00:11:59.292 --> 00:12:01.458
[Juro] ...he is a man of high principle.

205
00:12:03.167 --> 00:12:07.958
[Gennoh] <i>Very well. in that case.</i>
<i>you shall die alongside your Jedi friends.</i>

206
00:12:09.208 --> 00:12:10.792
[warbles]

207
00:12:12.167 --> 00:12:14.000
Bring the ground troops down.

208
00:12:14.083 --> 00:12:16.625
burn the whole city
and smoke out the Jedi.

209
00:12:17.875 --> 00:12:20.458
And do not forget
to take their lightsabers.

210
00:12:20.542 --> 00:12:22.208
[droid whirring]

211
00:12:22.292 --> 00:12:24.292
[â™ª dramatic music playing]

212
00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:33.125
[citizens exclaiming]

213
00:12:33.208 --> 00:12:34.208
[citizen 1] What is that?

214
00:12:41.292 --> 00:12:43.000
-[citizen 2] Here they come.
-[citizen 3] Oh. they're coming down!

215
00:12:43.083 --> 00:12:44.083
[citizen 4] They're landing!

216
00:12:44.167 --> 00:12:46.042
[panicked screaming]

217
00:12:46.125 --> 00:12:47.500
[thuds]

218
00:12:47.583 --> 00:12:49.583
[â™ª sinister music playing]

219
00:13:01.792 --> 00:13:03.333
[ships decelerate]

220
00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.875
[guard] Ready? Lure them closer.

221
00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:14.500
[blasters firing]

222
00:13:14.583 --> 00:13:17.208
-[explosion]
-[guards screaming]

223
00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:21.375
[guards gasping. whimpering]

224
00:13:21.458 --> 00:13:23.375
[guards groaning]

225
00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:28.083
[panting]

226
00:13:30.042 --> 00:13:31.542
[Homen panting]

227
00:13:32.167 --> 00:13:34.292
-[Kara grunts]
-[Homen sighs]

228
00:13:35.292 --> 00:13:36.500
This does not look good.

229
00:13:36.583 --> 00:13:39.083
They're attacking everyone
and everything in sight.

230
00:13:39.167 --> 00:13:40.500
-[Kara grunts]
-[Homen gasps]

231
00:13:41.708 --> 00:13:43.000
[Kara] This is horrible.

232
00:13:45.875 --> 00:13:48.917
-[gasps] Hold on. do you see our ship?
-[gasps]

233
00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:51.833
[Gramps] The ship's hidden.
You're welcome.

234
00:13:53.042 --> 00:13:54.542
Shall I come get you?

235
00:13:54.625 --> 00:13:56.750
Yeah. but be careful. okay?

236
00:13:56.833 --> 00:13:58.625
Even though we're outnumbered.

237
00:13:58.708 --> 00:14:01.833
these droids are controlled
by a central command unit.

238
00:14:01.917 --> 00:14:05.250
If you take that out. they'll become
nothing more than training dummies.

239
00:14:05.333 --> 00:14:09.917
Wait. Are you seriously proposing that we
directly infiltrate the enemy's ship?

240
00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.208
Have you lost your mind?

241
00:14:11.292 --> 00:14:14.417
The element of surprise
is a basic principle of warfare.

242
00:14:15.167 --> 00:14:16.167
Wouldn't you agree?

243
00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:19.500
"It is better to take the right path
than the straight one."

244
00:14:19.583 --> 00:14:23.375
Don't worry. I haven't forgotten the basic
principles of the Jedi's teachings.

245
00:14:24.333 --> 00:14:25.333
[Juro grunts softly]

246
00:14:25.417 --> 00:14:27.042
[panting]

247
00:14:27.125 --> 00:14:28.250
Hey. Gramps is here.

248
00:14:30.333 --> 00:14:33.458
Are you really planning
on attempting this alone?

249
00:14:33.542 --> 00:14:36.542
As you said.
your role is to protect your city.

250
00:14:36.625 --> 00:14:39.958
and in doing so. you will
be attracting the enemy's attention.

251
00:14:40.042 --> 00:14:41.917
-[droid warbles]
-[Dunbai] Hmm?

252
00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:44.833
[Juro] You'll need it at a time like this.

253
00:14:44.917 --> 00:14:46.042
So keep it.

254
00:14:46.125 --> 00:14:47.875
[Dunbai] Are you taking
that child with you?

255
00:14:47.958 --> 00:14:49.417
[Kara panting]

256
00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:50.917
I told you already.

257
00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:52.500
She's not just any girl.

258
00:14:52.583 --> 00:14:54.500
She's the daughter of Lah Zhima.

259
00:14:54.583 --> 00:14:56.083
Thank you for all your help.

260
00:14:56.917 --> 00:14:59.333
You have nothing to worry about.
We won't be reckless.

261
00:15:00.708 --> 00:15:01.792
[Kara panting]

262
00:15:02.833 --> 00:15:04.750
Hmm. [inhales]

263
00:15:07.292 --> 00:15:09.500
-[â™ª tense music playing]
-[distant explosions]

264
00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:14.625
We have to get out of this system. now.
It doesn't matter where to.

265
00:15:18.708 --> 00:15:19.917
[whooshes]

266
00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:24.250
[Kara] Where are we?

267
00:15:24.333 --> 00:15:27.500
We're approximately five parsecs
from Makoma Ko right now.

268
00:15:27.583 --> 00:15:29.375
If we jump back there right now.

269
00:15:29.458 --> 00:15:31.792
how close to the target
will we be able to get?

270
00:15:31.875 --> 00:15:35.333
[Gramps] Oh. my!
You are proving to be just as reckless

271
00:15:35.417 --> 00:15:37.542
-as young Kara here. sir.
-[Kara chuckles]

272
00:15:39.208 --> 00:15:40.500
[whooshes]

273
00:15:41.167 --> 00:15:42.583
[engine revving]

274
00:15:42.667 --> 00:15:44.667
[â™ª dramatic music playing]

275
00:15:45.833 --> 00:15:47.667
Gramps. we're gonna crash!

276
00:15:51.417 --> 00:15:52.750
[engine roaring]

277
00:15:57.792 --> 00:16:00.000
-[Gramps] You were saying?
-[sighs]

278
00:16:00.083 --> 00:16:01.583
Impressive flying.

279
00:16:01.667 --> 00:16:05.083
Our sole objective
is that central droid control unit.

280
00:16:07.083 --> 00:16:08.958
[droid] The enemy has infiltrated.

281
00:16:09.042 --> 00:16:11.333
Combat has been detected
on the third deck.

282
00:16:12.083 --> 00:16:14.542
[Gennoh] Their petty tricks
just keep on coming.

283
00:16:16.875 --> 00:16:18.667
-[blasters firing]
-[guards grunting]

284
00:16:20.333 --> 00:16:22.583
[guards screaming. grunting]

285
00:16:23.333 --> 00:16:25.292
[gasping]

286
00:16:25.375 --> 00:16:27.583
[Dunbai grunts]

287
00:16:30.458 --> 00:16:32.458
[gasps] Lord Dunbai.

288
00:16:32.542 --> 00:16:33.625
Come with me.

289
00:16:34.333 --> 00:16:35.333
Sir.

290
00:16:36.875 --> 00:16:38.958
[blasters firing]

291
00:16:39.042 --> 00:16:40.500
[guard grunts]

292
00:16:42.917 --> 00:16:44.458
[guards groaning]

293
00:16:45.167 --> 00:16:46.167
[Dunbai grunting]

294
00:16:51.667 --> 00:16:52.917
[guard gasps]

295
00:16:55.458 --> 00:16:58.333
[straining. panting]

296
00:17:03.792 --> 00:17:05.208
[electronic beeping]

297
00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:07.958
Hmm. Ah!

298
00:17:08.042 --> 00:17:10.875
There. That path leads directly
to the droid control center.

299
00:17:10.958 --> 00:17:13.333
-[lightsaber crackling]
-[metal thuds]

300
00:17:13.417 --> 00:17:14.667
Don't be reckless.

301
00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:15.750
[Kara] I know.

302
00:17:17.875 --> 00:17:19.500
[mechanical whirring]

303
00:17:24.542 --> 00:17:26.708
[grunting. panting]

304
00:17:28.125 --> 00:17:31.083
[Gennoh] And what business might you have
in this room. little mouse?

305
00:17:31.167 --> 00:17:32.167
[Kara gasps]

306
00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:36.708
Identify yourself.

307
00:17:36.792 --> 00:17:38.917
Are you the one in charge of this vessel?

308
00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:41.125
I am Gennoh Ikagi.

309
00:17:41.208 --> 00:17:43.125
The commander of Nawaam's army.

310
00:17:43.958 --> 00:17:48.708
Now you would do well to go to your death
with honor and at my hand.

311
00:17:48.792 --> 00:17:50.333
[lightsaber buzzing]

312
00:17:50.417 --> 00:17:53.250
[gasps] That's a lightsaber.

313
00:17:53.333 --> 00:17:54.833
How do you have one of those?

314
00:17:54.917 --> 00:17:56.792
Nobody but my father can craft them.

315
00:17:56.875 --> 00:17:58.042
[Gennoh] Your father?

316
00:17:59.333 --> 00:18:01.500
Then you are Lah Zhima's daughter?

317
00:18:01.583 --> 00:18:03.833
How do you know who my father is?

318
00:18:03.917 --> 00:18:07.250
[Gennoh] He is one of the General's
closest collaborators.

319
00:18:07.333 --> 00:18:09.625
And he has been very cordially received.

320
00:18:09.708 --> 00:18:10.708
What are you saying?

321
00:18:11.708 --> 00:18:12.917
-[whooshes]
-[Kara gasps]

322
00:18:13.958 --> 00:18:16.792
-[lightsaber crackling]
-[Kara grunts]

323
00:18:22.375 --> 00:18:23.500
[lightsaber buzzing]

324
00:18:24.958 --> 00:18:27.333
[â™ª tense music playing]

325
00:18:43.625 --> 00:18:45.208
[lightsabers buzzing]

326
00:18:45.875 --> 00:18:47.250
[Kara grunting]

327
00:18:48.125 --> 00:18:50.042
[lightsaber crackling]

328
00:18:52.667 --> 00:18:55.083
[Kara panting. grunts]

329
00:18:56.667 --> 00:18:58.125
[lightsaber buzzing]

330
00:18:58.208 --> 00:18:59.833
[lightsaber crackling]

331
00:19:01.333 --> 00:19:02.708
-[thuds]
-[Kara grunts]

332
00:19:03.708 --> 00:19:06.375
-[lightsabers crackling]
-[Kara straining]

333
00:19:07.042 --> 00:19:08.500
[Kara screams. grunts]

334
00:19:09.833 --> 00:19:11.250
[gasps]

335
00:19:11.333 --> 00:19:13.958
-[lightsaber crackling]
-[Kara gasps]

336
00:19:14.042 --> 00:19:15.958
[sizzling]

337
00:19:16.042 --> 00:19:18.458
[Kara panting]

338
00:19:18.542 --> 00:19:22.292
[Gennoh] You did well for a girl so young.
but this is the end.

339
00:19:22.375 --> 00:19:23.375
[Kara grunts]

340
00:19:23.458 --> 00:19:25.958
-I think I kept you busy long enough.
-[Gennoh] What?

341
00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:29.792
I just needed to keep you distracted

342
00:19:29.875 --> 00:19:32.542
so that my friend over there
could stop your droids.

343
00:19:32.625 --> 00:19:33.875
[Gennoh gasps]

344
00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:37.292
-[electricity crackling]
-[explosion]

345
00:19:38.792 --> 00:19:40.250
[droids powering down]

346
00:19:40.333 --> 00:19:43.417
[both gasp. chuckle]

347
00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:45.750
[droids powering down]

348
00:19:47.583 --> 00:19:49.458
[Dunbai gasps. sighs]

349
00:19:49.542 --> 00:19:51.917
[droids powering down]

350
00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.875
[rumbling]

351
00:19:54.958 --> 00:19:57.833
-[metallic creaking]
-[droids thud]

352
00:19:57.917 --> 00:19:59.750
[â™ª dramatic music playing]

353
00:20:00.875 --> 00:20:02.917
-[Kara gasps]
-[Gennoh grunts]

354
00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.333
[Kara] What was that? [gasps]

355
00:20:04.417 --> 00:20:07.958
[Gennoh] With the droids deactivated.
there's nobody to fly the ship.

356
00:20:08.042 --> 00:20:09.750
Or did you not account for that?

357
00:20:10.708 --> 00:20:11.708
Huh?

358
00:20:13.708 --> 00:20:16.500
[Gennoh] Tell me. what's your name. girl?

359
00:20:16.583 --> 00:20:17.958
-Kara.
-[Gennoh] Hmm.

360
00:20:18.042 --> 00:20:19.792
Lah Kara.

361
00:20:19.875 --> 00:20:23.750
[Gennoh] I will remember that
for the next time we meet.

362
00:20:29.542 --> 00:20:30.542
[gasps]

363
00:20:31.875 --> 00:20:33.167
Huh?

364
00:20:35.833 --> 00:20:37.208
[crashing]

365
00:20:41.708 --> 00:20:43.792
[citizens exclaiming]

366
00:20:43.875 --> 00:20:47.083
[citizens laughing]

367
00:20:47.875 --> 00:20:50.417
I can't believe
those guys actually pulled it off.

368
00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:52.792
Quite impressive indeed.

369
00:20:55.333 --> 00:20:57.708
[â™ª pensive music playing]

370
00:21:07.417 --> 00:21:08.625
[whooshes]

371
00:21:09.333 --> 00:21:10.958
[indistinct chatter]

372
00:21:13.917 --> 00:21:16.292
[alien chittering]

373
00:21:18.333 --> 00:21:20.958
-[alien chittering]
-[Homen gasps] Hmm?

374
00:21:21.042 --> 00:21:22.542
[indistinct chatter]

375
00:21:26.833 --> 00:21:27.833
[sighs]

376
00:21:29.042 --> 00:21:32.208
[Gennoh] He is one of the General's
closest collaborators.

377
00:21:32.292 --> 00:21:34.875
And he has been very cordially received.

378
00:21:36.458 --> 00:21:40.250
[Kara] <i>Father...</i>
<i>collaborating with Nawaam?</i>

379
00:21:40.333 --> 00:21:42.000
<i>That's impossible.</i>

380
00:21:42.083 --> 00:21:44.500
<i>He would never</i>
<i>willingly work with men like him.</i>

381
00:21:46.375 --> 00:21:47.375
<i>Never.</i>

382
00:21:47.458 --> 00:21:49.708
[â™ª melancholy music playing]

383
00:21:49.792 --> 00:21:53.542
They may be gone for now.
but this won't be the last we see of them.

384
00:21:53.625 --> 00:21:57.625
[Dunbai] Ah. but you forget.
Makoma Ko is a free city-state

385
00:21:57.708 --> 00:21:59.792
and we will yield to no one.

386
00:21:59.875 --> 00:22:02.083
[Juro] You're as stubborn as ever.

387
00:22:02.167 --> 00:22:03.750
[Dunbai] I could say the same of you.

388
00:22:05.458 --> 00:22:08.042
[grunts softly] Thanks for this.

389
00:22:08.125 --> 00:22:11.708
However. I left behind
the Jedi life long ago.

390
00:22:11.792 --> 00:22:15.167
You're even more stubborn than I thought.
[sighs]

391
00:22:15.250 --> 00:22:18.125
You don't have to go back to being a Jedi.

392
00:22:18.208 --> 00:22:20.833
but I'm not taking that back either.

393
00:22:20.917 --> 00:22:23.667
Keep it and use it
to protect the people of this planet.

394
00:22:25.125 --> 00:22:26.125
[Dunbai] Hmm.

395
00:22:36.625 --> 00:22:39.542
[ships whooshing]

396
00:22:39.625 --> 00:22:42.000
[â™ª tense music playing]

397
00:22:58.875 --> 00:23:01.292
[droid] Emergency transmission
from Gennoh.

398
00:23:01.375 --> 00:23:03.500
Juro's group has struck down his ship.

399
00:23:03.583 --> 00:23:05.250
Evacuation underway.

400
00:23:05.333 --> 00:23:08.583
[Nawaam sighs] That Margrave Juro
is formidable.

401
00:23:08.667 --> 00:23:10.125
[droid] There is more.

402
00:23:10.208 --> 00:23:12.583
Zhima's daughter is accompanying them.

403
00:23:12.667 --> 00:23:16.292
She is attuned to the Force
and not to be underestimated.

404
00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:22.750
[Nawaam] Lord Zhima. did you take
your daughter as your Padawan?

405
00:23:23.542 --> 00:23:26.167
She is the daughter
of a sabersmith after all.

406
00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:28.958
It's only natural
that she's picked up a few things.

407
00:23:29.583 --> 00:23:31.500
[Nawaam] You toy with me
at your own peril.

408
00:23:32.250 --> 00:23:36.417
Look at you.
one of the strongest of all the Jedi.

409
00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:40.417
yet you still insist on calling yourself
a mere sabersmith?

410
00:23:48.958 --> 00:23:50.750
[indistinct chatter]

411
00:23:57.375 --> 00:24:00.000
[Four-Nines speaking Binary]

412
00:24:00.083 --> 00:24:02.708
[in English] What?
Of course I'm not scared.

413
00:24:02.792 --> 00:24:05.458
I... I volunteered to do this after all.

414
00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:09.708
You're sure about this?

415
00:24:09.792 --> 00:24:11.917
This mission will be a dangerous one.

416
00:24:12.000 --> 00:24:14.083
I'm sure. Just leave it to me.

417
00:24:14.167 --> 00:24:16.542
[Four-Nines speaking Binary]

418
00:24:16.625 --> 00:24:18.167
[in English] It's okay. He'll have backup.

419
00:24:18.250 --> 00:24:20.750
Four-Nines will be there to help
if anything goes wrong.

420
00:24:20.833 --> 00:24:22.458
-[Four-Nines speaking Binary]
-[Ethan gasps]

421
00:24:23.333 --> 00:24:24.458
[chuckles]

422
00:24:25.125 --> 00:24:27.000
[indistinct chatter]

423
00:24:27.625 --> 00:24:30.750
[Ethan in English] So is this general
really as great as everyone claims?

424
00:24:30.833 --> 00:24:31.958
[man] Hmm?

425
00:24:33.292 --> 00:24:34.417
We'll know soon enough.

426
00:24:35.125 --> 00:24:36.917
[Ethan] Does anyone else
think it's strange

427
00:24:37.000 --> 00:24:39.500
that we all follow a guy
we don't know anything about?

428
00:24:39.583 --> 00:24:41.292
I heard that if anyone can beat him.

429
00:24:41.375 --> 00:24:43.375
he promised to give them
control of his army.

430
00:24:43.458 --> 00:24:45.583
Do we really think
he's serious about that?

431
00:24:46.750 --> 00:24:48.833
Why are you bringing that up?

432
00:24:48.917 --> 00:24:51.833
[stutters] I was just curious. that's all.

433
00:24:52.458 --> 00:24:54.375
-[Nawaam] I am serious.
-[all gasp]

434
00:24:55.333 --> 00:24:57.333
[â™ª tense music playing]

435
00:24:57.417 --> 00:24:59.750
[people murmuring]

436
00:25:00.500 --> 00:25:02.708
[people exclaim]

437
00:25:05.875 --> 00:25:07.708
[Nawaam] I do not request your loyalty.

438
00:25:07.792 --> 00:25:11.875
If any of you can kill me.
you may become general in my stead.

439
00:25:12.875 --> 00:25:15.500
However. until that happens.

440
00:25:15.583 --> 00:25:19.333
I am in command
and you will follow my orders.

441
00:25:20.167 --> 00:25:21.167
That is the deal.

442
00:25:22.708 --> 00:25:24.792
Did you want to challenge me?

443
00:25:26.500 --> 00:25:30.542
-How about you. masterless Jedi?
-[gasps]

444
00:25:32.833 --> 00:25:36.208
-[people murmuring]
-I have no idea what you're talking about.

445
00:25:37.125 --> 00:25:39.958
[Nawaam] You came to investigate my army.
did you not?

446
00:25:40.917 --> 00:25:42.958
Did you think you would go unnoticed?

447
00:25:44.750 --> 00:25:47.042
-[Ethan panting]
-[Four-Nines speaking Binary]

448
00:25:47.125 --> 00:25:48.125
[Ethan] Uh...

449
00:25:48.917 --> 00:25:50.250
[in English] That's a good point. Yeah.

450
00:25:50.333 --> 00:25:52.125
Juro's been looking for masterless Jedi

451
00:25:52.208 --> 00:25:54.667
and there's a chance
that he could be one of them.

452
00:25:54.750 --> 00:25:56.833
Hey. you. You a spy or something?

453
00:25:56.917 --> 00:25:59.500
You know. I bet he thinks
he's better than us.

454
00:25:59.583 --> 00:26:00.750
[growls. grunts]

455
00:26:00.833 --> 00:26:02.292
-[all exclaim]
-[grunts]

456
00:26:02.375 --> 00:26:04.083
[man grunting]

457
00:26:07.500 --> 00:26:09.375
Huh. Not half bad.

458
00:26:10.000 --> 00:26:12.583
[Nawaam] Agreed. You are quite skilled.

459
00:26:13.167 --> 00:26:15.458
However. with no lightsaber.

460
00:26:15.542 --> 00:26:19.292
I suppose that spear
is a more suitable weapon than a blaster.

461
00:26:19.375 --> 00:26:22.750
I had really hoped
that it would not need to come to this.

462
00:26:22.833 --> 00:26:24.750
However. there's no point anymore.

463
00:26:25.333 --> 00:26:27.542
-[spear slashes]
-This is a great opportunity.

464
00:26:28.208 --> 00:26:30.292
Now I can simply fight you.

465
00:26:31.458 --> 00:26:32.833
[Nawaam] Tell me your name.

466
00:26:32.917 --> 00:26:35.333
I will not give my name to a tyrant.

467
00:26:35.417 --> 00:26:37.542
[Nawaam chuckles] How noble of you.

468
00:26:42.167 --> 00:26:43.625
[lightsaber buzzing]

469
00:26:43.708 --> 00:26:45.292
-[gasps]
-[grunts]

470
00:26:47.042 --> 00:26:48.458
-[clangs]
-[Nawaam grunts]

471
00:26:50.458 --> 00:26:52.250
[â™ª dramatic music playing]

472
00:26:53.833 --> 00:26:55.792
-[man grunts]
-[spear clangs]

473
00:26:55.875 --> 00:26:57.458
[Ethan gasps]

474
00:26:57.542 --> 00:26:58.542
It's blue.

475
00:26:59.375 --> 00:27:01.042
Is Nawaam a Jedi?

476
00:27:02.500 --> 00:27:03.542
How?

477
00:27:05.542 --> 00:27:07.708
[â™ª dramatic music swells. ends]

478
00:27:09.042 --> 00:27:11.042
[â™ª theme music playing]

479
00:28:04.458 --> 00:28:05.958
[â™ª music ends]
